<title>CROATIA: Croatia central bank sells HRK 255.5 mln bills.</title>
<headline>Croatia central bank sells HRK 255.5 mln bills.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cratia's central bank sold 255.5 million kuna in 35- and 91-day liquidity bills on Wednesday compared with 131.5 million two weeks ago.</p>
<p>Issued rates were flat at 7.0 and 8.5 percent respectively.</p>
<p>The central bank put the net decrease at 34 million as 289.5 million in bills matured today.</p>
<p>-- Metka Jelenc, Zagreb Newsroom, 385 1 4557075</p>
</text>
